/2P6/9/P3P3P/6p2/9/2BAKcB2 b - - 0 25"}],"annotations":[{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment18:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment18","raw_text":"黑出肋车嫌急，可走卒7进1，变化也很复杂。","text":"黑出肋车嫌急，可走卒7进1，变化也很复杂。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":18,"anchor_node_id":"0:18","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment24:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment24","raw_text":"红炮击边卒，正着，如误走车四进三，黑则有卒3进1反扑的妙手。现黑卒7进1拉开了对攻的序幕。","text":"红炮击边卒，正着，如误走车四进三，黑则有卒3进1反扑的妙手。现黑卒7进1拉开了对攻的序幕。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":24,"anchor_node_id":"0:24","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment29:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment29","raw_text":"此时形势，红置三路马于不顾，毅然伸车塞象眼，击中要害，是凶狠之着。","text":"此时形势，红置三路马于不顾，毅然伸车塞象眼，击中要害，是凶狠之着。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":29,"anchor_node_id":"0:29","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment33:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment33","raw_text":"红又进炮打马，又一紧凑的妙手，不容黑方喘息。","text":"红又进炮打马，又一紧凑的妙手，不容黑方喘息。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":33,"anchor_node_id":"0:33","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment38:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment38","raw_text":"红方绳索越套越紧，黑方弃象无奈，如车3平1，则车八平二捉炮兼拴链车炮，下着马七进九即胜。","text":"红方绳索越套越紧，黑方弃象无奈，如车3平1，则车八平二捉炮兼拴链车炮，下着马七进九即胜。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":38,"anchor_node_id":"0:38","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment41:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment41","raw_text":"红移中炮瞄卒，志在必得，攻势凶猛，大局已定。","text":"红移中炮瞄卒，志在必得，攻势凶猛，大局已定。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":41,"anchor_node_id":"0:41","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment49:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment49","raw_text":"红胜。||黑方四面楚歌，只好起座认输。","text":"红胜。\n黑方四面楚歌，只好起座认输。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":49,"anchor_node_id":"0:49","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["广东刘星 先胜 浙江黄伯龙"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["第一章 中炮对屏风马类（56局）"],"DhtmlXQ_date":[